<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul stock market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Seoul stock market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Seoul stock market is closed on Wednesday for Buddha's Birthday. It will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the composite price index rose 1.75 percent, or 11.76 points to 683.86 in a technical rebound following the previous day's sell-off.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
